# Reaction dialogue.
#
# [Section]    starts a section (Reference or Forms)
# EVENT        all caps, one word: starts an event (Forms only)
# @slot        lowercase: groups the lines under it
# text(tags)   a line, with optional emotion tags at the very end
#
# {clause} {noun} {short} {habitual} are filled in from the Forms section.
# {target} is filled in when the event happens.
# Don't use # or [ inside dialogue lines.

[Reference]
@saw
I was there when {clause}.(fear)
I saw {short}.(fear, pity)
I haven't forgotten {noun}.(hate)
I saw {short}, and I haven't forgotten.(hate)
I'm sorry about {noun}.(pity)
{noun} was impressive.(respect)
I saw {short}. Impressive.(respect)

@heard
I heard {clause}.(fear, hate, respect)
Everyone's talking about {noun}.(fear)
Word is {clause}.(hate)
I heard about {short}.(pity)
I heard {clause}. I'm sorry.(pity)
Word of {noun} has spread.(respect)


[Forms]
KILL
@clause
you killed {target}
you beat {target}
you took down {target}(respect)
you cut down {target}(fear)
you murdered {target}(hate)

@noun
the death of {target}
that fight with {target}
your victory over {target}(respect)
the killing of {target}(hate)

@short
what happened to {target}
what you did to {target}

@habitual
you keep killing people around here
you keep picking fights
you keep winning fights(respect)

LOSE
@clause
you lost to {target}
{target} beat you
{target} knocked you flat(pity)

@noun
your fight with {target}
your defeat by {target}
that beating from {target}(pity)

@short
what happened with {target}

@habitual
you keep losing fights
you keep getting beaten(pity)

RUN
@clause
you ran from {target}
you fled from {target}
you backed down from {target}(hate)

@noun
how you ran from {target}
your retreat from {target}

@short
what happened with {target}

@habitual
you keep running from fights

DESTROY
@clause
you smashed {target}
you broke {target}
you wrecked {target}(hate)

@noun
the damage to {target}
the wreckage of {target}(hate)

@short
what you did to {target}

@habitual
you keep smashing things
you keep wrecking things(hate)

[Recipes]
default | Reaction 100 | Address 30 | Stance 70
fear | Reaction 100 | Stance 90 | Reference 60
hate | Reaction 60 | Address 20 | Stance 100 | Reference 60
pity | Reaction 100 | Address 40 | Stance 80 | Reference 50
respect | Reaction 100 | Address 50 | Stance 70 | Reference 50